      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/University_of_Texas_Health_Science_Center_at_San_Antonio",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The campus hosts the Institute for Drug Development, which runs one of the world’s largest oncology Phase I clinical drug trial programs.",
